### 🎮 Controls & Customization / วิธีใช้งานและการควบคุม

| UI Control (เมนู) | Description (คำอธิบาย) |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Enable Auto Farm** | Toggles the dynamic Level Farm on/off |
| **Auto Accept Quests** | Toggles automatic quest taking from NPCs |
| **Select Weapon** | Switch weapon auto-equip focus (`Melee`, `Sword`, `Blox Fruit`) |
| **Farm Distance** | Adjust hover height above mobs (Default: `9 studs`) |
| **WalkSpeed / JumpPower** | Adjust player movement performance on the fly |
| **Island Teleports** | Teleport instantly to any island with smooth tweening |

